    <string name="graph_starts_mind">The graph starts after about 10 seconds of signal.</string>
    <string name="explain_focus">How engaged your attention is. It drops when your mind wanders or you are relaxing. Measured at the forehead, so blinking and frowning can move it.</string>
    <string name="explain_calm">How settled you are. Calm rises when you relax with a clear mind, as in meditation. It falls when you feel tense, busy or restless, shown as Stressed.</string>
    <string name="explain_sleepiness">How sleepy you are. Rises as you drift towards sleep, for example while reading when tired. Keep your eyes open for a fair reading.</string>
